<title>FRANCE: ONIC reports bids for free-market wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>ONIC reports bids for free-market wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exporters made the following bids for refunds to export free-market grain at this week's EU tender, French cereals office ONIC said. Bids are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Oct 17 ---		 --- Oct 10---</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p> Soft wheat  622,000    5.87-13.50	591,250    5.74-13.00</p>
<p> Barley	278,000   29.95-35.94	353,000   30.87-36.37</p>
<p> Rye	     9,000   Not given	   17,000   Not given</p>
<p>ACP TENDER  Soft wheat   21,000   Not given	  No bids</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
